    toxic: "Friendship and community become toxic through gossip, control, exclusion, cliques and spiritual abuse. Communities can also demand loyalty that silences victims.",
    healthy: "Invest in a few deep friendships and a wider community where you are known and can serve. Practise honesty, loyalty, encouragement and forgiveness, and make room for the lonely and the outsider (Heb 10:24-25).",
