    healthy: "Give weight to others, especially the overlooked; honour God with your life and possessions; and receive the honour God gives you as his beloved child. Remember that true honour never requires covering harm.",
    refs: ["Ex 20:12", "Ps 8:5", "Prov 3:9", "Luke 14:7-11", "John 5:23", "John 12:26", "Rom 12:10", "1 Cor 12:23-24", "Phil 2:5-11", "Heb 12:2"],
    science: "",
    scienceUrl: ""
