    toxic: "Work becomes toxic through exploitation of workers, overwork and burnout, unjust wages (James 5:4) or idleness that refuses to contribute (2 Thess 3:10). Religious cultures that measure people by productivity can make work an idol.",
    healthy: "Work with diligence and creativity as service to God and neighbour, and rest regularly. Seek justice for workers, and let your identity rest in being beloved, not in your output.",
